{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"選委會選舉｜李慧琼：對投票率有信心　籲選民積極投票\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-22-12-14-343cScAi2k.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會主席李慧琼表示，此次選舉具有歷史性意義，相信當選人會具廣泛代表性，期望他們為香港建言獻策，並鼓勵選民積極投票。</p><p>立法會主席李慧琼：「現在距離投票結束還有一段時間，我也看到很多選民今早已經陸續到場。我再次呼籲所有選民出來積極投票，我對投票率是很有信心。」</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:03:25.540283+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:12:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:57:33.061232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:57:01.659613+00:00","content_hash":"37fd933369236822e98c89d8d0cd05bcfb57fa1a144955052547e0f914124276","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:03:25.540283+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}